{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586200/extras/66bc50014ca31edf1e8436ba8a2e2241.avif?t=1757037998\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having inherited the will of your late master, after years of research...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You finally succeed in creating a homunculus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is accomplished\u2014now all that\u2019s left is to hand it over to the government. There\u2019s no longer any reason to live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or so you thought...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus begins your life with the homunculus\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586200/extras/b2b9dc76681d8c6ee5627adb6b969f08.avif?t=1757037998\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A homunculus-raising simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While talking with the homunculus, you teach her about daily life and the world. Her personality changes depending on your actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take walks together, earn money through part-time jobs, and enjoy crafting through alchemy\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this is a raising game where you can experience many things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586200/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1757037998\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live2D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach a cute and innocent homunculus!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl\u2019s personality changes based on your actions</